{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-09_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-09","title":"再見，只為再見","storyCode":"M8-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"6713f9e2cb1f3da458df1f5733cd34a066a538c7d888bb879091da95524e3368","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topout"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的醫療技術......是比我們的強......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"向各個感染者聚落派遣醫護人員也在我們的計畫之內，但是戰亂地區的話，讓普通醫療幹員前去，太危險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，已經......可以了。這樣包紮就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人撤退了。戰場變大了。我沒法再用那個法術，找不到他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"那就靠我們的魔族佬吧，他們也很擅長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝你，羅德島的戰士。沒有你的驍勇作戰，我們的人員傷亡是不可避免的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛才聽到了，羅德島的領袖。卡特斯人，你要獨自前往指揮塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是，也不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"解釋一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"面對塔露拉的時候，可能只會有我一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也許，會有一位來自龍門的戰士幫助我......但我假定只有我一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你一個人怎麼殺死她？你不是大尉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，各位也不是。我們人越多，戰鬥起來就越束手束腳，何況塔露拉比愛國者先生更擅長短時間內壓制戰場的法術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我要帶一支小隊進去，只是因為指揮塔內必定也還有其他敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"夠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信我的小隊成員。他們都是最可靠也最擅長應對各種狀況的戰士。如果有我們沒法處理的情況，我們會徵求你們的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你想將我們排除在決戰之外？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不想主導這次戰鬥，只不過，先生，遊擊隊有只有你們才能處理的戰場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你想讓我們阻止其他人進入指揮塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米婭，你不想讓我去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"在指揮塔外的戰場上你會更安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想讓我和你一起戰鬥嗎？我們兩個人對抗塔露拉......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香，塔露拉的法術飽含能量，你也許很擅長處理各種物理上的傷害方式，但是，火焰的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"可我......可她......她殺了Ace，殺了我那麼多的親人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我為什麼不能去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我不擅長......我該怎麼辦？我能怎麼辦？我以前也有很多事情不擅長的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你恨塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢，不然呢！我難道不能恨她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你問的這些我也沒有答案。我不能說你不能恨一個你沒見過的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，迷迭香......分別之前，我有一個命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"命令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"命令一定要遵守......凱爾希說過，精英幹員要做到。我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——Logos在我們臨走前也對我說過，愛國者一生很少把別人稱作強敵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"以至於他喜歡用符號、特徵和裝備稱呼別人，反而不太用姓名和種族來代指。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他在剛才，他用菲林來叫你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也許他認可你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"他也這麼叫你，他叫你卡特斯。認可什麼？認可我這副讓人害怕的樣子嗎？我不想被這麼看待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是，如果說許多人把我們當作怪物，那愛國者先生已經被當作怪物很多很多年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的身體裡都藏著可怕的法術，沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但他當我們是人。當我們是......人類。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不是同類嗎？都是些......可怕的，一直會被人討厭的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不。你看看這些遊擊隊戰士，這些跟隨過其他整合運動領袖的戰士，我們的戰士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好的作為會贏得別人尊敬。壞的行為會被別人嫌惡討厭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的所作所為才是別人判斷我們的途徑。就像隊員們擁護你，就像盾衛擁護愛國者，就像我們願意信任凱爾希醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香，我的命令是，你要活下去，也要保證大家能夠盡可能地活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"為此，哪怕我會死去，你也不能來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！可你是......我的朋友，我怎麼能讓......讓你一個人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不！迷迭香。我保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我保證我也會活著回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，不管有人說了什麼，不管有人說我遭遇了什麼，我們都要各自做主，先完成我們自己的目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都要活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這個命令，也給在場的所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"切城營救行動，是為了拯救生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"核心城潛入行動，也是為了拯救生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不說“為了某種事業我們能拋棄生命”，不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"生命是寶貴的，是重要的，是屬於各位自己的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人，沒有任何一個人，能夠代我們浪費掉這次生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒有什麼犧牲是必要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這種說辭，一定是錯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Guard！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在聽，阿米婭......羅德島的領袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"對於整合運動也是一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。您說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就交給我們吧。菲林，我們走！去給這隻小兔子創造一片理想的戰場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......阿米婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一定要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。我一定會做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭小隊的成員們，跟我走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我們活著再見面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"再見......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"再見！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們，該做我們的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，就按遊擊隊這一套來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的戰場可不在這一小塊地方！來吧！讓我們把這幾條街區，全都變成我們的戰區！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島，走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"重複一遍，陳警司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我說的還不夠清楚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"很清楚。清楚到我懷疑自己聽錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警員，這不在你的職權範圍之內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"法律有國度之分，公理卻沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞皇家近衛學院教了你什麼？它有教你腳踏實地，不要好高騖遠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經畢業了。我已經是一個為龍門服務的警員了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那我重複一遍，聽好，“我的志願是加入近衛局，之後，我會加入特別督查組”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我會捍衛這座城市，也會讓它變得更乾淨。那種事不會再發生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"哪種事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你是真的健忘，還是故意裝傻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"注意你的言辭，陳警員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"報告魏長官，我所指的是距今十年前，龍門遭到外部勢力侵入，市民遭到綁架並自此失蹤的事件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"在我加入近衛局後，我依然會推動龍門對失蹤人口的進一步調查和追索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳......你不知道你在說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"報告長官，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會反對的。那就這樣吧，當你做不下去以後，就告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警司，你想在近衛局幹幾年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我沒回他。\n這麼多年過來，我一直想的是，我還能幹多久？我還要幹多久？\n只是現在我才發現，原來這個答案，一直不是我能決定的。\n最近赤霄劍在我手裡越來越鈍。我得到什麼時候才會理解，絕影不是逐影而行、絕不放手，而是不再回頭？\n“淚鋒之劍，當棄即棄。”"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彥吾"]}]}
